      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "PRADA has just unveiled its Fall/Winter 2026 handbag lineup this week, headlined by the new Avoir top-handle bag. Rendered in a clean, pared-back mini silhouette, its architectural lines strike an elegant, no-nonsense note. The Route multi-pocket bag, meanwhile, returns in sand-beige water buffalo leather that calls to mind a utilitarian kraft paper sack.",
